keyhole_0 WURM-SCHLÜSSELLOCH \nHm? Was hat das zu bedeuten???
keyhole_1 SCHLEIM-SCHLÜSSELLOCH \nHm? Was hat das zu bedeuten???
keyhole_2 WUNDER-SCHLÜSSELLOCH \nHm? Was hat das zu bedeuten???
keyhole_3 MASKEN-SCHLÜSSELLOCH \nHm? Was hat das zu bedeuten???
